    website: "https://aifitnessapi.com"
abstract: "19 open datasets about fitness and health APIs, each in JSON and CSV, built from the data modules that render aifitnessapi.com: State of Fitness APIs 2026; Health Data Type Matrix 2026 (HealthKit ↔ Health Connect); Fitness API Changes & Deadlines 2026; Fitness & Health API Glossary 2026; HealthKit Type Identifiers 2026; Health Connect Record Types 2026; Health Connect Permission Strings 2026; HealthKit Metadata Keys 2026; Wear OS Health Services Data Types 2026; Pose Keypoint Maps 2026; Google Health API Data Types 2026; Health and Fitness MCP Servers 2026; Bluetooth Fitness GATT Characteristics 2026; Workout Types Crosswalk 2026 (HealthKit, Health Connect, Wear OS, Google Health API); Exercise Form Rules 2026 (joint-angle thresholds from open-source trackers); Exercise Taxonomy Crosswalk 2026 (free-exercise-db, wger, ExerciseDB v1 to HealthKit and Health Connect); Fitness API Docs Drift 2026 (how often the sources behind this site's quotes changed); Fitness API Shutdown Notice 2026 (announcement to end date, per graveyard entry); Fitness API Pricing Transparency 2026 (who publishes a price, per vendor)."
keywords:
  - "fitness API"
  - "health data"
  - "HealthKit"
  - "Health Connect"
  - "wearables"
  - "open data"
